WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.042 --> 00:00:11.857
Native Oz ticket TIC001011 (control): full native MSP controls in Entry and Grid

2
00:00:11.857 --> 00:00:23.132
Customer (Alice) creates a board category and a disposable ticket on the shared Service Desk board

3
00:00:23.132 --> 00:00:30.883
MSP opens the same authoritative ticket in Entry and Grid

4
00:00:30.883 --> 00:00:34.548
MSP edits status, priority and category natively; persisted to the customer ticket

5
00:00:34.548 --> 00:00:37.002
MSP assigns its own technician in the Co-managed section

6
00:00:37.002 --> 00:00:39.040
Field and privacy boundaries for the MSP in Entry and Grid

7
00:00:39.040 --> 00:00:46.891
Customer sees MSP edits and assignment, assigns natively and writes privately

8
00:00:46.891 --> 00:00:58.370
MSP sees the customer assignee but not the customer-private note

9
00:00:58.370 --> 00:02:13.110
Ended Kansas Farms workspace: read-only check (no mutation attempted)

10
00:02:13.110 --> 00:02:24.270
Restore: MSP clears its assignment on the disposable ticket
